    -> no-change-to-token-cost-or-reuse-reporting  [regression/explicit]
       The change does not alter reporting of tokens, cost, or reused-token share.

[exclusion-06] What a token costs.
    -> exclude-token-cost  [functional/explicit]
       The change does not address what a token costs.

